OL,3,GNEWSACyclist dies after collision with
OL,4,Acoach
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cyclist in his 60s has died following
OL,7,Fa collision with a coach.
OL,9,FHertfordshire Police was called to
OL,10,FGreat North Road in Potters Bar, near
OL,11,Fthe junction with Church Road, at 08:36
OL,12,FBST on Tuesday.
OL,14,FThe cyclist was pronounced dead at the
OL,15,Fscene and detectives are appealing for
OL,16,Fwitnesses or anyone with dashcam
OL,17,Ffootage to come forward.
OL,19,FA 58-year-old man arrested on suspicion
OL,20,Fof causing death by careless driving
OL,21,Fhas been bailed pending further
OL,22,Fenquiries.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
